<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG, MAGONI TIE FOR FIRST IN WOMEN'S SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WIBERG, MAGONI TIE FOR FIRST IN WOMEN'S SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colorado 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overall World Cup champion Pernilla Wiberg of Sweden and Italy's Lara Magoni tied for first place in the season-ending women's slalom on Sunday, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Katja Seizinger of Germany finished third.</p>
